{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Acceptance-criteria evidence (all verified against landed commit 22efd71f10, merged to main; CI Verified+1 on py3.11/3.12/3.13 incl. real 3.13.15):\n1. gen_cli_help.py --check determinism/completeness — scripts/gen_cli_help.py implements write + --check; --check rc=0 verified locally on py3.12, py3.13.5, and py3.13.15 with byte-identical artifacts, and green in CI's build-and-test across the version matrix. Covered by tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py (missing/stale/stray/blank-summary/determinism branches, sandboxed).\n2. Overview uniqueness/grouping + alias/hidden/retired rules — render_overview in gen_cli_help.py; verified by tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py and tests/interfaces/contracts/test_help_overview_coverage.py; _OVERVIEW_OMIT handles compatibility entrypoints.\n3. Both top-level help forms serve committed bytes BEFORE operation/config/store/parser/handler/optional-import boundaries — src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:pre_scan runs first in _cli/__init__.py; sentinel/pre-boundary tests in tests/interfaces/contracts/test_create_help_no_write_b8de.py and central-mount-gate tests pass.\n4. Free-text later --help, malformed global syntax, unknown commands, streams, exit codes — b8de test_malformed_config_prefix_falls_through_to_the_real_cli (added this change, mutation-verified), plus free-text/unknown negative controls; exit-code conformance suites green.\n5. Normal execution negative control still reaches RP-04 op composition + mount/init — test_ordinary_create_still_writes (b8de) creates exactly one ticket via the real ladder.\n6. No hand-maintained usage/option table remains — all help/*.txt regenerated from factories; enriched _parsers/core and _parsers/advanced carry the prose; gen --check fails on any hand-authored drift. Only the capitalized 'Usage:' prefix preserved byte-for-byte."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787295393584086001,"uuid":"d2c05ed2-cfea-47ad-9102-59dabeadc59e"}